  "item": [
    {
      "name": "🔗 Passthrough Create",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "1. Generate Access Token",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "const jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "const accessToken = jsonData.access_token;",
                  "",
                  "pm.environment.set(\"access_token\", accessToken);"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "packages": {},
                "requests": {}
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "basic",
              "basic": [
                {
                  "key": "password",
                  "value": "{{client_secret}}",
                  "type": "string"
                },
                {
                  "key": "username",
                  "value": "{{client_id}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "transactionId",
                "value": "{{$guid}}",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "institutionId",
                "value": "{{institution_id}}",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/x-www-form-urlencoded",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "urlencoded",
              "urlencoded": [
                {
                  "key": "grant_type",
                  "value": "client_credentials",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{apigee_base_url}}/oauth2/v1/token",
              "host": [
                "{{apigee_base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "oauth2",
                "v1",
                "token"
              ]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "2. Passthrough Create",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "const path = pm.environment.get(\"mx_platform_resource_path\");",
                  "const jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "const guid = jsonData.user?.guid;",
                  "",
                  "const guidPath = `${path.replace(/\\/$/, \"\")}/${guid}`;",
                  "pm.environment.set(\"mx_platform_resource_path_guid\", guidPath);"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "packages": {},
                "requests": {}
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{access_token}}",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "correlationId",
                "value": "{{$guid}}",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "ext_host",
                "value": "{{mx_platform_host}}",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "{{mx_accept}}",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "{{mx_content_type}}",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept-Version",
                "value": "{{mx_accept_version}}",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"user\": {\n        \"email\": \"{{user_email}}\",\n        \"id\": \"{{user_partner_id}}\"\n    }\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{apigee_base_url}}/mx/{{mx_platform_resource_path}}",
              "host": [
                "{{apigee_base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "mx",
                "{{mx_platform_resource_path}}"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Forward a create request to the MX API through the Apigee passthrough.\n\nSaves `mx_platform_resource_path_guid` to the environment.\n\n```\nPOST /mx/{{mx_platform_resource_path}}\n```"
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ],
      "description": "## 🔄 MX Platform Passthrough Create Flow\n\n| **Step** | Request Name | **Description** |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 | Generate Access Token | Obtain an access token using client credentials to authorize API requests. |\n| 2 | Passthrough Create | Send a POST request through the proxy, mapping to the corresponding MX Platform API resource. |",
